# Generated figures. Every PNG in this repo is produced by a script from the
# CSVs and the STEP -- plots/, output/overlap/ and anything added later -- so
# they are rebuildable and do not belong in history.
#
# plots/ stays listed separately: that whole directory is generated, not just
# the images in it.
*.png
plots/
